  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AC 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……啊？\n不跟那家伙面对面，\n它就不会动吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 06}看来是这样……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不面对它，它就不动……\n面对它，它就会动……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}原来如此！\n只要面对着它后退，\n就能把它引过来！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 11 01 0B 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……啊，我明白了！\n确实和直斗说的一样！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 0C}……侦探真厉害。\n明明是第一次见到这种Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ，\n却一下就解决了问题。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C7 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}不、没有。\n我只是稍微观察了一下……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}……那、那么，\n整理一下这种敌人的特点吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这只Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ，\n{F2 01 03 01}会在与它面对面地前后移动时行动{F2 01 01 01}。\n不与它面对面，它就不会动。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_310.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}接下来……\n就交给队长了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
